From 733fafa97501a8827b42aadd60cd11652b763e8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Doug Rabson <dfr@rabson.org>
Date: Wed, 26 Jul 2023 15:00:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] allow freebsd as a host os

Control plane components build and work on FreeBSD. This change just
removes a confusing error message when building on FreeBSD.
---
 hack/lib/util.sh | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/hack/lib/util.sh b/hack/lib/util.sh
index ed067cc7a30..14f6ed96c9b 100755
--- a/hack/lib/util.sh
+++ b/hack/lib/util.sh
@@ -144,6 +144,9 @@ kube::util::host_os() {
     Darwin)
       host_os=darwin
       ;;
+    FreeBSD)
+      host_os=freebsd
+      ;;
     Linux)
       host_os=linux
       ;;
-- 
